":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-20T00:05:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T19:51:01Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T15:54:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122619","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122619.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-20T15:54:57Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen compiling Godot on macOS, fresh without installing any of the dependencies, these messages appear:\r\n\r\n```\r\nBuilding for macOS 13.0+.\r\nWARNING: The screen reader support driver requires dependencies to be installed.\r\nYou can install them by running `python3 misc/scripts/install_accesskit.py`.\r\nSee the documentation for more information:\r\n        https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.html\r\nAlternatively, disable this driver by compiling with `accesskit=no` explicitly.\r\nWARNING: The ANGLE rendering driver requires dependencies to be installed.\r\nYou can install them by running `python misc/scripts/install_angle.py`.\r\nSee the documentation for more information:\r\n        https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.html\r\nAlternatively, disable this driver by compiling with `angle=no` explicitly.\r\n```\r\n\r\nA few things are wrong:\r\n\r\n- The macOS command needs to be `python3`. Just `python` does not work.\r\n- It is not correct to link to the Windows documentation article in `platform/macos/detect.py`.\r\n- The link does not include the section of the page, when it should include that.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes these problems, and additionally:\r\n\r\n- Move the `\\t` and `\\n` out of the line the link is on, in order to fix Cmd/Ctrl + clicking the link in IDEs like VS Code.\r\n- Makes the same change for macOS AccessKit, adding the section to the link, and moving `\\t` and `\\n`.\r\n- Makes the same change for Windows, adding the section to the link, and moving `\\t` and `\\n`.\r\n- EDIT: Makes the same change for Linux AccessKit, Windows AccessKit, Windows DX12.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used at all.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"http